WEBVTT

00:01:30.910 --> 00:01:33.910
The fall colors are at 
their most vibrant,

00:01:33.910 --> 00:01:37.620
and it's the perfect time to 
relax at the hot springs.

00:01:44.130 --> 00:01:46.870
It's useless. I can't find a spring.

00:01:47.290 --> 00:01:50.210
You're digging your own 
hot spring, Orochimaru?!

00:01:50.590 --> 00:01:51.420
Yes!

00:01:51.650 --> 00:01:56.440
I've been running myself ragged trying
to find one all week, and nothing!

00:01:58.570 --> 00:01:59.510
There's no other option.

00:02:00.500 --> 00:02:01.970
I'll just have to...

00:02:11.440 --> 00:02:15.440
<b>Nothing Beats Mixed Bathing!</b>

00:02:16.250 --> 00:02:18.150
I am pooped.

00:02:18.640 --> 00:02:21.230
That mission was brutal.

00:02:21.230 --> 00:02:22.870
Must sleep...

00:02:23.260 --> 00:02:25.550
I wouldn't mind a rest, either.

00:02:25.550 --> 00:02:27.560
This is no time to take it easy!

00:02:27.940 --> 00:02:29.550
We must hurry home and 
start training feverishly

00:02:29.550 --> 00:02:31.960
so we'll be ready for the next mission!

00:02:32.140 --> 00:02:33.450
Not this time.

00:02:33.450 --> 00:02:35.920
Warriors need their rest, too!

00:02:36.200 --> 00:02:37.220
Guy Sensei?

00:02:37.610 --> 00:02:39.550
I've been told a new hot spring business

00:02:39.550 --> 00:02:41.450
just opened close to the Leaf Village.

00:02:41.450 --> 00:02:43.510
You should all go check it out.

00:02:43.790 --> 00:02:48.980
Your next mission is, 
"give your body a nice long rest!"

00:02:50.370 --> 00:02:53.090
And that's how Rock 
Lee and his ninja pals...

00:02:53.090 --> 00:02:56.630
...found themselves in front of the
newly-opened "Orochi Hot Springs."

00:02:57.160 --> 00:02:58.030
Look at that!

00:02:58.030 --> 00:03:04.740
<b>Orochi Hot Springs:
100% natural
spring water</b>

00:02:58.600 --> 00:03:02.200
All the baths are 100% 
natural spring water!

00:03:03.550 --> 00:03:04.740
"Orochi" Hot Springs?

00:03:05.140 --> 00:03:07.200
Oh no, not him again...

00:03:08.340 --> 00:03:11.000
Oh yes, none other!

00:03:12.310 --> 00:03:15.020
Look at them. The fools 
don't suspect a thing.

00:03:15.310 --> 00:03:17.580
Quite the opposite.

00:03:18.090 --> 00:03:21.720
Lord Orochimaru, they couldn't 
be more suspicious!

00:03:21.720 --> 00:03:25.180
Why the heck did you have to
call it the Orochi Hot Springs?!

00:03:25.540 --> 00:03:28.140
This must be one of Orochimaru's traps!

00:03:28.140 --> 00:03:29.820
Was his plan to get us to relax,

00:03:29.820 --> 00:03:31.100
then attack while our guard was down?

00:03:31.400 --> 00:03:33.100
<b>Precisely!</b>

00:03:31.550 --> 00:03:33.100
C-Curses!

00:03:33.100 --> 00:03:34.480
One second.

00:03:36.510 --> 00:03:40.030
Welcome one and all to the 
Okuchichi Hot Springs!

00:03:40.240 --> 00:03:41.980
Okuchichi?

00:03:41.980 --> 00:03:42.780
Yes.

00:03:43.490 --> 00:03:46.660
This isn't a "ro," it's the 
kanji that reads "kuchi."

00:03:46.970 --> 00:03:49.310
We are the Okuchichi Hot Springs!

00:03:51.260 --> 00:03:53.830
<i>Lord Orochimaru, that's 
much too far-fetched.</i>

00:03:54.230 --> 00:03:56.760
I see. It's read as "Okuchichi."

00:03:56.760 --> 00:03:58.910
He fell for it?!

00:03:58.910 --> 00:04:02.500
Well, it's true that if this 
were one of Orochimaru's tricks,

00:04:02.500 --> 00:04:05.880
he wouldn't actually use "Orochi" 
in the name of the place.

00:04:05.880 --> 00:04:08.810
Yeah, Orochimaru wouldn't 
screw up that bad.

00:04:08.810 --> 00:04:10.510
Indeed!

00:04:10.510 --> 00:04:14.720
He may be a failure, 
but even he's not that stupid!

00:04:15.440 --> 00:04:17.270
<i>I'll get you for that.</i>

00:04:17.270 --> 00:04:20.990
Come along and enjoy our 
beautiful outdoor bath!

00:04:24.910 --> 00:04:26.240
I-It's—

00:04:26.240 --> 00:04:27.740
<b>Mixed Gender 
Outdoor Bath</b>

00:04:28.110 --> 00:04:29.600
It's a mixed gender bath!

00:04:29.600 --> 00:04:31.450
M-Mixed?!

00:04:32.360 --> 00:04:35.910
As you might imagine, 
in a mixed gender bath,

00:04:35.910 --> 00:04:37.970
the men and women don't 
have separate areas,

00:04:37.970 --> 00:04:39.710
but rather bathe and 
enjoy the water together.

00:04:40.140 --> 00:04:42.880
M-M-M-M-M-M-M-M-M-M-Mixed?!

00:04:43.200 --> 00:04:45.320
A mixed gender bath with Sakura?

00:04:45.320 --> 00:04:48.140
Me and Sakura in the same hot spring!

00:04:49.930 --> 00:04:52.370
What should we do? Take turns?

00:04:52.940 --> 00:04:55.850
There's not much time left 
until dinner, though...

00:04:55.990 --> 00:04:59.270
I know. The Transformation Jutsu 
will solve this conundrum!

00:04:59.680 --> 00:05:00.590
Naruto!

00:05:00.590 --> 00:05:02.350
Right, I'm on it!

00:05:04.710 --> 00:05:05.480
Neji!

00:05:05.480 --> 00:05:06.070
Hey, st—

00:05:07.540 --> 00:05:08.950
And me!

00:05:09.550 --> 00:05:11.580
Now we're all girls.

00:05:11.580 --> 00:05:13.550
We call go in the bath together!

00:05:13.550 --> 00:05:15.160
Somehow, I don't think so.

00:05:15.360 --> 00:05:18.720
Actually, he might be on to something.

00:05:19.690 --> 00:05:22.050
If you and I use the technique...

00:05:24.240 --> 00:05:26.720
Ah ha, good thinking!

00:05:34.750 --> 00:05:39.060
They had to put on towels before 
we were allowed to shoot.

00:05:35.770 --> 00:05:38.110
I shouldn't have gotten my hopes up.

00:05:39.430 --> 00:05:43.280
This is much too dull. 
There aren't even any flowers.

00:05:44.150 --> 00:05:46.240
These will at least brighten up the shot.

00:05:49.510 --> 00:05:54.410
They had to put on swan tutus 
before we were allowed to film.

00:05:54.920 --> 00:05:57.220
We can do without those kinds of flowers.

00:05:57.220 --> 00:06:00.630
What if they washed each other instead?

00:06:02.480 --> 00:06:03.530
Wash, wash!

00:06:03.530 --> 00:06:05.050
Rub, rub!

00:06:05.310 --> 00:06:09.130
Who on earth is this 
supposed to appeal to?!

00:06:11.370 --> 00:06:13.620
What a relaxing bath!

00:06:13.620 --> 00:06:16.020
The food's great, too!

00:06:16.530 --> 00:06:18.500
Eat up, everyone!

00:06:19.000 --> 00:06:22.930
And enjoy our dinnertime dance show!

00:06:25.370 --> 00:06:27.440
<i>Why me?</i>

00:06:27.860 --> 00:06:28.790
<i>For some reason...</i>

00:06:28.790 --> 00:06:31.620
<i>I feel a strong bond with that girl.</i>

00:06:32.000 --> 00:06:33.670
What is it, Neji?

00:06:33.670 --> 00:06:35.930
That girl really catch your eye?

00:06:35.930 --> 00:06:37.850
O-Of course not!

00:06:37.850 --> 00:06:39.830
Whoohoo!

00:06:41.000 --> 00:06:42.790
I think it's about time...

00:06:43.610 --> 00:06:45.690
About time for what?

00:06:45.690 --> 00:06:47.800
Even better food?

00:06:48.220 --> 00:06:49.300
Wrong!

00:06:50.740 --> 00:06:54.430
Time to punish you little brats!

00:06:54.790 --> 00:06:55.970
Orochimaru!

00:06:55.970 --> 00:06:56.990
I knew it!

00:06:56.990 --> 00:06:59.170
It's too late now.

00:06:59.170 --> 00:07:02.890
You're all too loosened up from my resort!

00:07:02.890 --> 00:07:04.440
Give me a break!

00:07:04.980 --> 00:07:06.230
Rasengan!

00:07:08.180 --> 00:07:11.410
I see the hot springs really 
helped your chakra unwind.

00:07:11.410 --> 00:07:13.320
Chakra can't unwind!

00:07:13.320 --> 00:07:14.070
Byakugan!

00:07:15.470 --> 00:07:17.450
It's no good. I can't see 
what kind of soup it is!

00:07:17.450 --> 00:07:19.040
The soup, now?!

00:07:19.680 --> 00:07:22.380
He's right, the springs 
relaxed our chakra so much,

00:07:22.380 --> 00:07:24.080
we can't use ninjutsu!

00:07:24.480 --> 00:07:27.000
So chakra can relax, then?

00:07:27.420 --> 00:07:31.210
You think you stand a chance 
against me without ninjutsu?

00:07:31.770 --> 00:07:34.560
This hot spring will be your grave!

00:07:34.560 --> 00:07:38.220
Even without ninjutsu, 
I can still fight with taijutsu!

00:07:38.480 --> 00:07:39.430
Lee!

00:07:39.430 --> 00:07:40.850
Don't worry!

00:07:40.850 --> 00:07:43.440
I've got a style that's a 
perfect fit for hot springs...

00:07:45.300 --> 00:07:46.700
Karaoke-Fu!

00:07:47.060 --> 00:07:48.420
Wha...

00:07:48.420 --> 00:07:51.070
I think ping-pong is more 
hot-springy, personally.

00:07:51.340 --> 00:07:54.160
Interesting. I'll play along!

00:07:58.160 --> 00:07:59.740
They're out for blood.

00:07:59.740 --> 00:08:01.970
Who'll sing first?

00:08:01.970 --> 00:08:03.080
And what song?

00:08:03.540 --> 00:08:07.850
I'll sing the theme song to 
that other famous ninja anime,

00:08:07.850 --> 00:08:09.550
Courage 200%!

00:08:09.950 --> 00:08:11.500
They're actually singing!

00:08:11.500 --> 00:08:13.800
I give us a 200% chance of dying!

00:08:14.090 --> 00:08:17.710
Have you no pride as a 
Leaf Village Ninja, Lee?!

00:08:17.710 --> 00:08:20.490
But singing what he wants 
is a small victory!

00:08:21.270 --> 00:08:23.110
Bringing out the big guns already, huh?

00:08:23.110 --> 00:08:27.520
I'll counter with a song from 
that famous idol group!

00:08:27.750 --> 00:08:29.480
"Heavy Boa-tation!"

00:08:27.780 --> 00:08:29.480
<b>Heavy BOA-tation!</b>

00:08:29.880 --> 00:08:33.200
Lord Orochimaru, you're risking 
both defeat and a lawsuit!

00:08:33.200 --> 00:08:36.320
You'll tarnish the image 
of those poor girls!

00:08:36.760 --> 00:08:39.130
Are you two sure about this?

00:08:39.480 --> 00:08:42.040
If you sing on air without 
licensing the songs first—

00:08:42.520 --> 00:08:43.890
Let's do it!

00:08:43.890 --> 00:08:45.080
Have at you!

00:08:47.680 --> 00:08:50.210
The karaoke machine 
mysteriously exploded.

00:08:50.210 --> 00:08:52.390
See, it's telling you you can't sing.

00:08:52.390 --> 00:08:55.930
There are forces far more 
powerful than us at work here.

00:08:56.410 --> 00:09:00.140
We'll have to pick an alternate way
to fight that's still theme appropriate.

00:09:01.880 --> 00:09:05.520
I would've liked to avoid 
doing this on a kids' show...

00:09:05.520 --> 00:09:08.190
Oh no, you're going 
to break the rules?!

00:09:09.270 --> 00:09:10.190
Baseball Fist!

00:09:10.500 --> 00:09:11.540
Don't do it, Lee!

00:09:11.540 --> 00:09:14.030
You can't do that in prime time!

00:09:14.030 --> 00:09:15.740
There's no stopping now!

00:09:16.840 --> 00:09:18.860
Orochi High vs. Leaf Academy.

00:09:18.860 --> 00:09:20.330
It's 0-0, bottom of the ninth,

00:09:20.330 --> 00:09:22.360
two outs, and the bases are loaded.

00:09:22.360 --> 00:09:24.620
Orochi High could end it right here!

00:09:25.110 --> 00:09:26.220
Big brother...

00:09:27.200 --> 00:09:28.860
The count's 0-2.

00:09:28.860 --> 00:09:30.340
Will the next pitch be the last?!

00:09:30.850 --> 00:09:32.920
<i>I have to win this game,</i>

00:09:32.920 --> 00:09:35.300
<i>for my dear, beloved sick sister!</i>

00:09:35.540 --> 00:09:38.130
<i>Regardless of your circumstances...</i>

00:09:38.990 --> 00:09:40.960
<i>I'm going all out!</i>

00:09:46.370 --> 00:09:49.610
The pitcher, Rock Lee, sets up...

00:09:50.790 --> 00:09:52.020
And throws!

00:09:52.430 --> 00:09:55.990
<i>I will win, at any cost!</i>

00:10:00.670 --> 00:10:03.130
He's hit by the pitch!

00:10:06.410 --> 00:10:08.540
Yes! I won!

00:10:08.850 --> 00:10:10.430
Like heck you did!

00:10:10.430 --> 00:10:13.430
The bases were loaded and you hit me,

00:10:13.430 --> 00:10:14.880
my team won!

00:10:15.310 --> 00:10:17.110
Are you kidding me?

00:10:17.110 --> 00:10:18.890
That was just the baseball.

00:10:18.890 --> 00:10:21.350
Our battle was about breaking the rules!

00:10:21.350 --> 00:10:23.320
What?!

00:10:23.320 --> 00:10:24.810
You lousy cheater!

00:10:26.740 --> 00:10:27.890
That tears it.

00:10:28.510 --> 00:10:30.020
Summoning Jutsu!

00:10:33.110 --> 00:10:36.530
Now what, a giant monster battle?

00:10:36.960 --> 00:10:38.490
Orochimaru, you coward!

00:10:39.710 --> 00:10:42.840
I'll crush the life out of 
you for sure this time!

00:10:42.840 --> 00:10:43.830
Freeze.

00:10:45.780 --> 00:10:47.290
Who are you?

00:10:47.540 --> 00:10:51.170
From the cheapest day spa
to the most well hidden gems,

00:10:51.440 --> 00:10:55.130
we fight to protect the waters and
atmosphere of all hot springs!

00:10:55.690 --> 00:10:58.700
We are the hot spring 
inspecting Spa Rangers!

00:11:00.040 --> 00:11:03.780
The minerals in the water here are
added, not naturally occurring!

00:11:03.780 --> 00:11:05.350
You're coming with us.

00:11:05.550 --> 00:11:07.560
Hey, wait a sec—

00:11:07.970 --> 00:11:10.000
Hi-ho, Silver!

00:11:11.700 --> 00:11:13.630
I won't forget this!

00:11:13.630 --> 00:11:15.230
Lord Orochimaru!

00:11:16.150 --> 00:11:20.870
And so, Orochimaru won the 
battle, but lost the war.

00:11:21.200 --> 00:11:22.990
Uh...

00:11:28.760 --> 00:11:34.830
As always, Orochimaru is plotting 
to defeat our Rock Lee.

00:11:33.420 --> 00:11:42.860
<b>Rock Lee Hotel</b>

00:11:35.570 --> 00:11:37.390
Look at this.

00:11:37.390 --> 00:11:39.240
I've created a most 
dastardly "Rock Lee Hotel,"

00:11:39.240 --> 00:11:42.040
to trap that eyebrowed 
eyesore once and for all!

00:11:43.970 --> 00:11:46.090
What should I use as bait?

00:11:46.090 --> 00:11:50.150
A curry restaurant stamp card that
needs just one more for a free meal?

00:11:50.150 --> 00:11:55.000
Or an all-you-can-drink 
on your birthday coupon?

00:11:56.440 --> 00:12:02.400
<b>October 27th</b>

00:11:56.620 --> 00:11:58.080
I completely forgot!

00:11:58.080 --> 00:12:02.400
My own birthday was last week!

00:12:08.370 --> 00:12:12.370
<b>October 27th Was Orochimaru's Birthday...</b>

00:12:13.680 --> 00:12:16.070
Another year older...

00:12:16.610 --> 00:12:20.290
My makeup's having less 
and less effect, too...

00:12:21.160 --> 00:12:22.380
Hey, wait!

00:12:22.800 --> 00:12:24.180
The real tragedy is...

00:12:24.180 --> 00:12:28.410
...not one single soul 
remembered my birthday!

00:12:28.410 --> 00:12:29.900
Why?!

00:12:29.900 --> 00:12:32.050
Why, I say?!

00:12:32.050 --> 00:12:34.190
Lord Orochimaru?

00:12:34.190 --> 00:12:35.310
Kabuto!

00:12:35.310 --> 00:12:36.590
You callous fiend!

00:12:36.590 --> 00:12:38.730
You've forgotten something important!

00:12:38.730 --> 00:12:41.960
Something of great significance 
happened last week!

00:12:41.960 --> 00:12:44.200
Great significance...?

00:12:45.110 --> 00:12:46.150
That's right!

00:12:46.150 --> 00:12:48.080
Last week was the first episode of

00:12:48.080 --> 00:12:51.540
"Make-Out Fall in Love Picking 
Chestnuts on Mt. Sarukani,"

00:12:51.540 --> 00:12:52.980
and I forgot to set my DVR!

00:12:54.940 --> 00:12:56.250
No, you twit!

00:12:56.250 --> 00:12:58.880
It was something much more 
important than television!

00:13:02.460 --> 00:13:06.060
Manda, I know you remembered, right?

00:13:06.060 --> 00:13:09.190
Something absolutely critical, 
starts with "b."

00:13:13.270 --> 00:13:14.310
B Vitamins

00:13:14.080 --> 00:13:15.140
B Vitamins.

00:13:15.140 --> 00:13:17.100
No!

00:13:17.780 --> 00:13:20.420
Hey, B vitamins are important 
to a healthy lifestyle.

00:13:21.230 --> 00:13:23.300
I'm not talking about health!

00:13:23.300 --> 00:13:28.840
Something that starts with "b" that's
much more important than vitamins!

00:13:28.840 --> 00:13:30.660
Bulbs? Like light bulbs?

00:13:32.260 --> 00:13:34.220
If you're going to bring up lighting,

00:13:34.220 --> 00:13:36.990
at least use LEDs, they use 
so much less electricity!

00:13:37.760 --> 00:13:39.080
Birthday!

00:13:39.080 --> 00:13:42.600
B-i-r-t-h-day!

00:13:42.600 --> 00:13:45.260
Oh, is that right?

00:13:45.850 --> 00:13:49.140
I'll make Lee suffer the same anguish.

00:13:49.710 --> 00:13:52.720
Let's see, Lee's birthday 
is coming up...

00:13:52.720 --> 00:13:55.550
It's November 27th.

00:13:55.550 --> 00:14:01.180
He, too, will suffer the loneliness, 
the misery, the agony...

00:14:01.180 --> 00:14:05.330
...of having his birthday forgotten!

00:14:16.560 --> 00:14:18.730
What in the world are you wearing?

00:14:19.670 --> 00:14:26.170
I can't ask Kabuto for help when 
he forgot my birthday, too.

00:14:26.630 --> 00:14:30.090
I'll just have to play his 
part myself, instead!

00:14:30.090 --> 00:14:33.350
Lord Orochimaru, that's enough exposition.

00:14:34.570 --> 00:14:35.850
You're right.

00:14:35.850 --> 00:14:37.940
First I need my time-release chakra.

00:14:44.130 --> 00:14:47.470
I'll slip it into his shoes,

00:14:47.470 --> 00:14:51.240
and set it to go off the 
morning of his birthday.

00:14:51.770 --> 00:14:53.840
It's my birthday!

00:14:53.840 --> 00:14:55.550
Happy birthday to me!

00:14:58.930 --> 00:15:03.490
Then I'll set a black 
cat to cross his path.

00:15:04.320 --> 00:15:05.710
A black cat!

00:15:06.020 --> 00:15:07.720
And finally, when he 
looks to the sky...

00:15:08.780 --> 00:15:11.680
He'll see the death 
star clear as can be!

00:15:13.170 --> 00:15:15.140
I saw the death star on my birthday!

00:15:15.470 --> 00:15:21.070
He'll have the most miserable 
birthday morning of his life!

00:15:21.340 --> 00:15:23.330
That plan's unbearably 
dull, Lord Orochimaru.

00:15:23.330 --> 00:15:24.620
Who cares?

00:15:24.620 --> 00:15:27.640
Piling up one little annoyance after
another can do a lot of damage!

00:15:28.580 --> 00:15:30.620
H-Hey, Orochimaru!

00:15:30.620 --> 00:15:32.700
What're you doing with my shoes?

00:15:33.670 --> 00:15:37.390
Lord Orochimaru, if you're found out now
the whole plan will go down the tubes.

00:15:37.390 --> 00:15:38.950
You have to trick her, and fast.

00:15:39.420 --> 00:15:40.900
Oh, I—

00:15:40.900 --> 00:15:43.700
It's getting colder out now,

00:15:43.700 --> 00:15:47.170
so I'm warming up everyone's
shoes so they won't catch colds.

00:15:47.590 --> 00:15:50.960
That makes no sense!

00:15:52.250 --> 00:15:56.600
Th-They're in for a big surprise if
they think I'll give up that easily.

00:15:57.020 --> 00:15:59.220
I've got lots of other options...

00:15:59.220 --> 00:16:01.060
The morning of his birthday,

00:16:01.060 --> 00:16:04.520
I'll make him step in dog doo!

00:16:04.900 --> 00:16:05.650
Are we clear?

00:16:06.140 --> 00:16:11.200
I want you to drop plenty of land mines
on Lee's morning running course!

00:16:11.200 --> 00:16:12.990
And you're feeding him a month out?

00:16:20.400 --> 00:16:22.890
I will not be broken.

00:16:22.890 --> 00:16:25.830
I've got plenty more in store for him.

00:16:27.170 --> 00:16:30.310
Your happy birthday lands on the
anniversary of Buddha's death!

00:16:30.860 --> 00:16:32.580
And even worse...

00:16:34.200 --> 00:16:36.680
Friday the 13th

00:16:39.630 --> 00:16:42.480
Lord Orochimaru, if it's the 13th,

00:16:42.480 --> 00:16:44.690
that means it's not his birthday.

00:16:45.220 --> 00:16:49.460
What else would ruin someone's birthday?

00:16:50.010 --> 00:16:53.400
I know, I'll search the internet!

00:16:53.400 --> 00:16:56.850
Coogle Leaf

00:16:53.680 --> 00:16:56.850
Worst birthday memories ever

00:16:57.450 --> 00:16:58.680
Let's see here...

00:16:58.680 --> 00:17:01.450
None of my subordinates 
remembered my birthday.

00:17:01.840 --> 00:17:02.900
Even when I asked,

00:17:02.900 --> 00:17:06.000
"Didn't you forget something important?"

00:17:06.000 --> 00:17:10.140
all they could talk about were
vitamins and light bulbs and stuff.

00:17:10.840 --> 00:17:13.840
Wait, this is my blog!

00:17:13.840 --> 00:17:16.470
Lord Orochimaru, you have a blog?!

00:17:18.420 --> 00:17:20.030
It's clear now.

00:17:20.030 --> 00:17:23.270
Of all the things that can
happen on your birthday,

00:17:23.270 --> 00:17:24.890
that is the worst!

00:17:28.690 --> 00:17:31.460
Whew, it's about time.

00:17:31.460 --> 00:17:32.840
We're finally back onscreen!

00:17:32.840 --> 00:17:35.570
I wasn't sure we'd even show up again.

00:17:35.590 --> 00:17:41.330
<b>Yum!</b>

00:17:35.590 --> 00:17:41.330
<b>Orochi Ramen</b>

00:17:35.590 --> 00:17:41.330
<b>Open 11/27</b>

00:17:35.590 --> 00:17:41.330
<b>First 10 customers get an all-you-can-eat buffet!!</b>

00:17:35.880 --> 00:17:39.090
Hey, look, a new restaurant.

00:17:39.090 --> 00:17:41.330
Sweet, it's a ramen place!

00:17:42.140 --> 00:17:44.910
Open November 27th.

00:17:44.910 --> 00:17:48.400
First 10 customers get an 
all-you-can-eat buffet!

00:17:48.400 --> 00:17:50.790
Oh man, I'm lining up first 
thing in the morning!

00:17:51.760 --> 00:17:53.760
It begins.

00:17:54.310 --> 00:17:57.710
I bet Choji will want 
to come along, too.

00:17:57.710 --> 00:18:01.220
Nope, Choji said he's going over there.

00:18:01.220 --> 00:18:03.180
<b>November 27th

00:18:01.220 --> 00:18:03.180
<b>Orochi Barbecue</b>

00:18:01.220 --> 00:18:03.180
<b>All-you-can-eat!!</b>

00:18:03.360 --> 00:18:07.260
Another promo on November 27th?

00:18:08.800 --> 00:18:10.830
Wait, November 27th?

00:18:10.830 --> 00:18:12.900
Yes. What's up, Neji?

00:18:13.330 --> 00:18:17.540
That's funny, the Hyugas are
holding a memorial service that day.

00:18:18.190 --> 00:18:20.530
It should've been the day before,

00:18:20.530 --> 00:18:22.090
but for some reason they 
couldn't book the venue,

00:18:22.090 --> 00:18:23.620
and had to push it back.

00:18:24.030 --> 00:18:25.330
Now that you mention it,

00:18:25.330 --> 00:18:29.030
Lady Tsunade's women's
summit is that day,

00:18:29.030 --> 00:18:31.590
and I was planning on attending.

00:18:31.950 --> 00:18:33.900
So everyone has plans on the 27th?

00:18:33.900 --> 00:18:37.630
What's so special about November 27th?

00:18:40.510 --> 00:18:43.260
November 27th is...

00:18:43.260 --> 00:18:44.970
...Fishing Day!

00:18:44.970 --> 00:18:45.810
Fishing day?

00:18:47.020 --> 00:18:49.760
Yes! The fishiest day of them all!

00:18:49.760 --> 00:18:53.280
The village fishing holes are letting
us catch as much as we want!

00:18:53.800 --> 00:18:56.150
Another thing on the 27th!

00:18:56.450 --> 00:18:59.030
Actually, I invited Kakashi along, too,

00:18:59.470 --> 00:19:02.120
but he's lining up for this.

00:19:00.030 --> 00:19:02.120
<b>Make-Out Mixed Bath</b>

00:19:00.110 --> 00:19:02.120
On sale 11/27!!

00:19:00.240 --> 00:19:02.120
<b>New Chapter!</b>

00:19:02.960 --> 00:19:06.080
Why are so many things 
happening on that day?

00:19:07.770 --> 00:19:12.100
November 27th is my birthday!

00:19:12.520 --> 00:19:14.500
Don't tell me you're all...

00:19:15.610 --> 00:19:19.230
<i>That's right, I'm behind all of it.</i>

00:19:19.870 --> 00:19:23.770
<i>Now no one will be able to 
make your birthday party.</i>

00:19:23.770 --> 00:19:25.400
<i>You'll be all alone,</i>

00:19:25.400 --> 00:19:29.350
<i>crying into your birthday cake!</i>

00:19:29.350 --> 00:19:32.100
Don't tell me you're all...

00:19:32.870 --> 00:19:37.180
You're all conveniently making
plans so that Sakura and I can...

00:19:37.180 --> 00:19:41.320
...spend my birthday together, 
just the two of us!

00:19:43.400 --> 00:19:45.900
How can you be so positive?!

00:19:45.900 --> 00:19:47.590
And the night of my birthday,

00:19:47.590 --> 00:19:49.580
when Sakura and I are all alone,

00:19:49.580 --> 00:19:51.990
it'll be like those risqué manga...

00:19:52.760 --> 00:19:55.420
Happy birthday, Lee.

00:19:55.420 --> 00:19:57.630
Come unwrap your present.

00:19:58.060 --> 00:20:03.350
I'm a bit embarrassed, 
but so, so happy!

00:20:03.350 --> 00:20:05.110
That's crossing the line, Bushy-Brows!

00:20:05.110 --> 00:20:08.190
Sakura would never do something 
like that for you!

00:20:08.190 --> 00:20:12.230
Ah, so the 27th is Lee's birthday, too.

00:20:13.450 --> 00:20:16.820
<i>Enjoy yourself while you can.</i>

00:20:17.580 --> 00:20:18.780
<i>Because!</i>

00:20:18.780 --> 00:20:21.380
<i>Oh, you'll get a present,</i>

00:20:21.870 --> 00:20:23.740
<i>but it won't be that Sakura girl!</i>

00:20:24.490 --> 00:20:27.490
Come unwrap your present!

00:20:30.250 --> 00:20:35.080
I see, so you arranged to be
delivered to him on the 27th?

00:20:35.550 --> 00:20:36.500
Yes...

00:20:36.500 --> 00:20:39.780
Right as Lee's at the height of despair,

00:20:39.780 --> 00:20:42.250
Orochimaru will pop out to cheer him up!

00:20:44.910 --> 00:20:46.340
What's this package?

00:20:46.340 --> 00:20:48.060
I heard something laughing inside.

00:20:48.060 --> 00:20:49.790
Must be a joke.

00:20:49.790 --> 00:20:51.730
It's creeping me out, let's just trash it.

00:20:54.520 --> 00:20:56.150
H-Hey, stop!

00:20:56.150 --> 00:20:57.360
No!

00:20:57.360 --> 00:20:59.440
I'm not garbage!

00:20:59.440 --> 00:21:01.690
No!

00:21:09.510 --> 00:21:11.820
Surprise. {V: Is that really all he says?}

00:21:12.420 --> 00:21:18.100
It's a little late, but Happy 
Birthday, Lord Orochimaru.

00:21:19.100 --> 00:21:20.620
Kabuto...

00:21:20.620 --> 00:21:23.340
Why didn't you do this 
on the right day?!

00:21:23.770 --> 00:21:26.610
Because, Lord Orochimaru, 
you were wandering...

00:21:26.610 --> 00:21:29.300
...the mountains looking for 
a hot spring on that day.

00:21:29.850 --> 00:21:31.760
I had no idea where you were!

00:21:34.850 --> 00:21:38.490
All's well that ends 
well, right, Orochimaru?

00:21:38.490 --> 00:21:40.430
Happy Birthday!

00:21:40.960 --> 00:21:44.990
Thank you, everyone!

00:23:22.050 --> 00:23:29.010
<b>Sakura's My Nurse!
One Vote For Rock Lee!</b>

00:23:22.390 --> 00:23:22.880
Next time—

00:23:22.880 --> 00:23:26.160
Next time is "Sakura's My Nurse!"

00:23:26.160 --> 00:23:28.760
and "One Vote For Rock Lee!"

00:23:28.760 --> 00:23:31.870
Hey, Lord Orochimaru's supposed 
to be doing the preview,

00:23:31.870 --> 00:23:32.970
don't cut him off!

00:23:32.970 --> 00:23:33.840
It's all right.

00:23:34.490 --> 00:23:36.440
We're celebrating my birthday,

00:23:36.440 --> 00:23:39.100
I want everyone to share in my joy.

00:23:39.100 --> 00:23:41.030
Just this once.

00:23:41.030 --> 00:23:43.890
Lord Orochimaru, that's not 
how the bad guy should talk.

00:23:43.890 --> 00:23:45.270
I'm the bad guy?
